    "title": "Millionaires Rally to Tie Mount Everett - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By iBerkshires.com Sports ,\n37 minutes ago SHEFFIELD, Mass. – Ahmet Yildiz scored back-to-back goals in the last 18 minutes of play to give the Lenox boys soccer team a 3-3 tie with Mount Everett on Wednesday. The Eagles jumped on top early with a goal from Philip Enoch in the sixth minute. But the visitors’ Renzo Merino scored the equalizer nine minutes later. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
